!04-Archives/Daily/.gitkeep
!04-Archives/Daily/README.md
!04-Archives/Daily/Timeline.md
!04-Archives/Daily/Chat-Correlation.md

04-Archives/Memory-Review/*
!04-Archives/Memory-Review/README.md
!04-Archives/Memory-Review/TEMPLATE.md
!04-Archives/Memory-Review/Memory-Board.kanban
!04-Archives/Memory-Review/HERMES-PREAMBLE.md

03-Resources/Research/**
!03-Resources/Research/README.md

# Generated logs and reports
04-Archives/Audit-Reports/*.log
04-Archives/Audit-Reports/*-Report.md
04-Archives/Audit-Reports/*-Performance.md
02-Areas/Skills/Skill-to-Chat-Links.md

# Backward-compatibility ignore rules
Daily/**
!Daily/.gitkeep
!Daily/README.md
Memory-Review/*
!Memory-Review/TEMPLATE.md
Research/**
!Research/README.md
Skills-Notes/*.log
Skills-Notes/*-Report.md

# Smart environment (local ML models, event logs, smart blocks state)
.smart-env/
!/.smart-env/README.md
